TI  - Triage of 2D Mammographic Images Using Multi-view Multi-task Convolutional Neural Networks
AU  - Kyono, Trent
AU  - Gilbert, Fiona J.
AU  - van der Schaar, Mihaela
T2  - ACM Transactions on Computing for Healthcare
PY  - 2021
VL  - 2
